      "created_at": "2025-01-02T19:08:18Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-01-02T19:08:18Z",
      "body": "I tested by backing out the change to `faulthandler.c`.  That test case does trigger a crash but not on every run.  So, reducing the loop iterations is probably not a good idea.  So, I think we can just leave that test as is.\r\n\r\nThanks for fixing this bug!",
